{
  "id": 20,
  "name": "tightened_return_with_lookahead",
  "intent": "Steepen the parent's return ramp (0.1+0.5p from 0.15+0.4p) so late-tour closure dominates more aggressively, reduce regret's early weight (0.15-0.1p from 0.25-0.15p) since the stronger return term now handles late-stage structure, and add a constant nearest_remaining penalty (0.1) preferring candidates that can chain into the next step via proximity to other unvisited cities. This lookahead particularly helps uniform instances where return-distance is uninformative and local chaining decisions dominate tour quality.",
  "tags": [
    "return_aware",
    "lookahead"
  ],
  "code": "def priority(f):\n    d = f[\"distance\"]\n    r = f[\"return_distance\"]\n    g = f[\"regret\"]\n    p = f[\"progress\"]\n    n = f[\"nearest_remaining\"]\n    return -d + (0.1 + 0.5 * p) * r + (0.15 - 0.1 * p) * g - 0.1 * n",
  "source": "live_llm",
